                "image": "virality-fake-news.png",
                "titleEn": "Virality and Fake News: How to Distinguish Reliable Information?",
                "titleFr": "Viralité et fake news : comment distinguer la bonne information ?",
                "dateEn": "Published on September 3, 2026",
